* Technical concepts\nbehind the 2020 hacks
** Flash loans and prices
*** Spot price from one DEX (bZx, February)
*** Vault share priced from Curve reserves (Harvest)
*** LP token priced from reserves (Warp)
** Tokens that do not behave
*** ERC-777 hooks (Uniswap v1, Lendf.Me)
*** Fee-on-transfer token and gulp() (Balancer)
*** Fake tokens in deposits (Akropolis)
** Accounting mistakes
*** Self-transfer doubles a balance (bZx, September)
*** msg.value reused in a loop (Opyn)
*** Stale memory copy of a struct (Cover)
** Access control and arbitrary calls
*** Public helper moving approved tokens (Bancor)
*** Delegatecall to an approved converter (Pickle)
** Below the contracts
*** Hot wallet keys (KuCoin)
*** 51% reorganisations (Ethereum Classic)
*** Liquidations at zero bids (MakerDAO)
@endmindmap
